@startuml
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F5F5

' ====== Акторы ======
actor Developer as developer
actor Patient as patient
actor "Medical Staff" as doctor
actor "External AI Service" as ai_service

' ====== Системы ======
rectangle "Infrastructure as Code (IaC) System" as iac {
  [Terraform] as terraform
  [GitHub Repo] as repo
  [CI/CD Pipeline] as pipeline
}

cloud "Yandex Cloud" as yandexcloud {
  [Virtual Machine] as vm
  [Object Storage] as s3
  [VPC Network] as vpc
}

database "Main Database" as db

rectangle "Web Portal" as portal {
  [Frontend UI]
  [Backend API]
}

rectangle "Fintech System" as fintech {
  [Payment Gateway]
  [Billing]
}

cloud "AI Platform" as ai {
  [ML Model Server]
  [Inference API]
}

rectangle "Medical Devices" as medical {
  [MRI Scanner]
  [ECG Monitor]
  [IoT Gateway]
}

' ====== Связи ======
developer --> repo : Push code / PR
repo --> pipeline : Trigger CI/CD
pipeline --> terraform : Run plan/apply
terraform --> yandexcloud : Provision resources
yandexcloud --> vm : VM created
vm --> db : Connect
vm --> portal : Hosts backend/frontend
vm --> fintech : Process payments
vm --> ai : Send data for analysis
vm --> medical : Receive device data

portal --> patient : Access medical data
portal --> doctor : Dashboard, reports
medical --> vm : Stream real-time data
ai --> vm : Return AI diagnostics
fintech --> portal : Confirm payments

' ====== Заметки ======
note right of iac
  Система управления инфраструктурой
  - Terraform + GitHub Actions
  - Управляет ВМ, сетью, хранилищем
  - Безопасное развёртывание
end note

note right of yandexcloud
  Облако:
  - ВМ: хостит приложение
  - S3: хранит состояние
  - VPC: изолированная сеть
end note

note right of portal
  Web Portal:
  - Доступ для пациентов и врачей
  - Просмотр результатов
  - Управление приёмами
end note

note right of fintech
  Fintech System:
  - Оплата услуг
  - Счёта, подписки
  - Интеграция с банками
end note

note right of ai
  AI Platform:
  - Анализ МРТ, КТ
  - Прогнозирование заболеваний
  - Поддержка диагностики
end note

note right of medical
  Medical Devices:
  - Сканирование, мониторинг
  - Передача данных в облако
  - Требует высокой доступности
end note

note left of developer
  Developer:
  - Пишет IaC
  - Запускает пайплайн
end note

note left of doctor
  Medical Staff:
  - Диагностика
  - Работа с данными
end note

note right of patient
  Patient:
  - Просмотр результатов
  - Запись на приём
end note

@enduml

